"Ascendants' Hope is a Unique Legendary class the Crimson Blight grants its champion."
"The System and Gaia both add power to Ascendants' Hope."
"It grants five points in every attribute each level, plus five free points."
"Its ability Ascendant's Insight analyzes eldritch corruption and may reveal divine secrets."
"Its trait Eldritch Bane helps against beings of other planes and the pantheon's mutants."
"Its trait Skill Master uncaps every known skill and teaches a new one each month."
"Its trait Omni Affinity raises affinity with every frequency of mana."
"Its bearer draws the hunting instinct of every corrupted entity."
